auCvEAnikACDK6ziMEfcNm8XH23sQIbnf5iG53-Y\"/><figcaption>甚少公開露面。（微博@黃𨥈瑩）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Keep得好。（微博@黃𨥈瑩）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211009/523603510441283584238061.jpeg/qNGj3MKz_HZHf_2NBeipEpRkb0oUGtlVdg3UdHYN1HQ\"/><figcaption>Keep得好。（微博@黃𨥈瑩）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Keep得好。（微博@黃𨥈瑩）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211009/523603824330412032527918.jpeg/OESXXl3xdTpLKjrUpesIFeYQ9qPSQf_W14n26teJ9uo\"/><figcaption>Keep得好。（微博@黃𨥈瑩）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Keep得好。（微博@黃𨥈瑩）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211009/523604376577642496531296.jpeg/tChUv_JFP9r2FCKoJj5iW4CEtzXvOtp_b5l4RW-ZeEU\"/><figcaption>Keep得好。（微博@黃𨥈瑩）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"拍檔。（微博@黃𨥈瑩）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211009/523604578575323136740839.jpeg/aAzhdAxT6k6Fh-rsf79C8KsKuBzcyEp0FW71HBVu9Rw\"/><figcaption>拍檔。（微博@黃𨥈瑩）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T10:43:56.745807+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1423,"images":36,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T10:30:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:22.751065+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T10:37:30.149367+00:00","content_hash":"fad193fd0fdd8e9da5b328ee2292b5218c67c307f6862decb4251c2229ba069e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}